{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"中间他想说自己多喜欢这样待着，也想知道对方是否也喜欢，念头却淡了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"想起这些日子对方总愿意跟他待在一起，他渐渐觉得，对方也许也喜欢两个人这样亲近。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"那点没底越来越具体：要是哪天对方不再愿意像现在这样跟他亲近呢？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"等那阵轻松过去，他忽然想，眼下两个人这样亲近，他不想再把喜欢藏起来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可两个人以后还能不能这样亲近，不是他能说了算的；一想到这里，刚才的欢喜就压得他心口发疼。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"那阵高兴过后，他更想知道对方是否也舍不得这份亲近；可就算两个人都舍不得，也未必留得住。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他想起最初连多露一点喜欢都紧张，那时越是欢喜，越有点鼻酸。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"g56与g6共同指出的几处偏离均成立：S03补回对相互心意的在意；S07从对方是否需要陪伴转回两个人是否都喜欢这份亲近；S09把害怕的重点放回亲密关系本身；S11分别调整当下的选择和未来无法留住亲近的痛；S13从索要不变的保证转为盼望对方也舍不得这份亲近；S14从不后悔的自我确认转为欢喜中已经带着鼻酸。没有两位读者意见相反的情况。以下内容不判为需要修改：S05的相处无措、S06-3的双方留恋之问、S07-3希望被对方主动想起的愿望、S09-3对现实事实与心意猜测的区分，均按守护清单保留。S08-2与S08-3保留，因为未来的盼望紧接着被眼前无法保证的现实打断，仍是幸福与失去之痛的交织。S11-2保留自我接纳，S12-2与S12-3保留明知留不住仍想多相处、终于放开喜欢的推进，S13-2与S13-3保留害怕性质的变化和不愿再隐藏的选择，S14-2与S14-3保留结尾的清醒与最终决定。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3558e409-4d4f-4d1a-a245-7181bd663c79", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T101253806312Z", "elapsed_seconds": 405.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:19:39.437085+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "169ce17b1e266139ac2605fc2631de22197a89c3ce94ab44b1d8205b30beab49", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T101253806312Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ba61cf10060107e31fc07338fb31bd6109fc01db867ac9f0ee2bce08df1b9cee"}}}
